OL,3,GNEWSAKey findings from Lucy Letby
OL,4,AThirlwall Inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public inquiry into how serial
OL,7,Fkiller Lucy Letby was able to murder
OL,8,Fbabies at the Countess of Chester
OL,9,Fhospital has delivered its findings,
OL,10,Fdescribing a "complete failure" to
OL,11,Fprotect infants from harm.
OL,13,FAfter hearing from more than 130
OL,14,Fwitnesses, and considering 400
OL,15,Fstatements over six months, the
OL,16,FThirlwall Inquiry report was published
OL,17,Fearlier at Liverpool Town Hall.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
